---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const upgrades = await getCollection('upgrades');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free Resources | Nomad Tax Help Blog"
  description="Free guides, checklists, and tools for digital nomads sorting their tax residency, US LLC, and international setup."
>
  <div class="max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <p class="font-heading text-amber-600 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-4">Free resources</p>
    <h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-cream-100 mb-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-[-0.01em]">Paraguay residency checklists and quote worksheet</h1>
    <p class="text-cream-soft/85 mb-10 max-w-lg text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      If you have two proposals, use the worksheet to compare what each provider will actually deliver. If you are preparing to travel, use the document checklist to record which originals you have, who issued them and which ones still need certification.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-8 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-teal-900">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-2">What if a quote just says “documents included”?</h2>
      <p>Suppose one quote includes document checks and another includes translations. Those are two different jobs. Ask both providers to price the same birth and police records, specify who orders and translates each one, and mark any missing fee as unknown on the worksheet. Once both quotes cover the same work, their totals will tell you something useful.</p>
      <p class="mt-2">If you are still working out which police record to order, the <a class="underline" href="/blog/posts/paraguay-residency-requirements">document guide explains which country should issue your clearance</a>. You can read it immediately without giving an email address.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="space-y-5">
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-teal-900/20 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-2"><a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/blog/resources/compare-paraguay-residency-quotes">Compare two Paraguay residency quotes</a></h2>
        <p>Enter each package price, add the costs you would pay separately and see which figures you still need from the provider. You can print a blank or completed worksheet.</p>
      </article>
      {upgrades.map((upgrade) => (
        <div class="bg-cream-100 text-teal-900 p-6 sm:p-7" style="border-radius: 0.625rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);">
          <p class="text-xl mb-2" aria-hidden="true">📄</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-teal-900 text-xl mb-1 leading-snug">{upgrade.data.title}</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-teal-900/75 mb-4 leading-relaxed">{upgrade.data.description}</p>
          <form class="resource-form flex gap-2" data-upgrade-id={upgrade.data.id} aria-label={`Get ${upgrade.data.title}`}>
            <label for={`resource-email-${upgrade.data.id}`} class="sr-only">Email address</label>
            <input
              id={`resource-email-${upgrade.data.id}`}
              type="email"
              name="email"
              placeholder="you@example.com"
              autocomplete="email"
              required
              aria-label="Email address"
              class="flex-1 px-3 py-2 border border-teal-900/20 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-600"
              style="border-radius: 0.625rem;"
            />
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="btn-shimmer px-5 py-2 font-heading font-semibold text-sm shrink-0"
              style="border-radius: 0.625rem;"
            >
              Get the PDF
            </button>
          </form>
          <p class="resource-success hidden text-sm text-green-600 mt-2"><a class="underline font-semibold" href={upgrade.data.pdfUrl} download>Download {upgrade.data.title} (PDF)</a></p>
          <p class="resource-error hidden text-sm text-coral-600 mt-2">Something went wrong. Try again.</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <section class="mt-10 space-y-3 text-teal-900">
      <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl">More tools for planning your move</h2>
      <p>If you are weighing up destinations, <a class="underline" href="/masterclass/why-paraguay">compare Paraguay with Dubai and Portugal</a> on residency, time in country and costs.</p>
      <p>Use the <a class="underline" href="/tax-check">nomad tax questionnaire</a> to identify questions about your current ties, or browse the <a class="underline" href="/nomad-tools">tools directory</a> for help with everyday travel and remote work.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.resource-form').forEach((form) => {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const f = e.target as HTMLFormElement;
      const success = f.parentElement?.querySelector('.resource-success');
      const error = f.parentElement?.querySelector('.resource-error');
      success?.classList.add('hidden');
      error?.classList.add('hidden');

      const email = new FormData(f).get('email') as string;
      const upgradeId = f.dataset.upgradeId;

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/blog/api/subscribe', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ email, upgradeId, source: 'resources-page' }),
        });
        if (res.ok) {
          success?.classList.remove('hidden');
          f.reset();
        } else {
          error?.classList.remove('hidden');
        }
      } catch {
        error?.classList.remove('hidden');
      }
    });
  });
</script>
